{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/6b7b3cc9eda3e894e8a67bd3dbc2984c.poster.avif?t=1773358092\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/6b7b3cc9eda3e894e8a67bd3dbc2984c.webm?t=1773358092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/6b7b3cc9eda3e894e8a67bd3dbc2984c.mp4?t=1773358092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of Mesmerism in <strong>Querent</strong>, a tactical role-playing game set in an alternate American Southwest. Within the exile colony of Sunset Junction, rally the locals and wield their psychic abilities through tarot to free the wildlife from a dark, subterranean eldritch technology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/6a3b777c5a69b29a40e8b89ce9396fd2.avif?t=1773358092\" width=598 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/448dff5caf2ef44453423351a07307a0.webp?t=1773358092\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance and body type of your exile. Build your deck as you play to decide what kind of person you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369500/extras/4e4857666a31742e479c49f9ba9c849a.poster.avif?t=17733580